// Title: Potential RoboForm.DLL Sideloading
// Rule ID: f64c9b2d-b0ad-481d-9d03-7fc75020892a
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
